	Q)why we need to learn the linux commands??
	A)we can go for the multitasking operation.
	  we can reduce the task time by maximizing the productivity of the work.
	 Q)what is the reason that we are preferred for linux than other operating systems??
	 1)open source:
	 		as an open source operating system,linux allows users to view and modify the source code,which means that it is more transparent and customizable.
	2)security:
			linux is generally considered to be more secure when compared to other operating systems,particular for servers.
			it is less vulnerable to virsues and other types of malware,it can easily configured to ensure the security of system.
	3)stability:
		linux is known for stabilty which makes it a good choice for the servers.
	4)performance:
			linux is generally fast and more efficent when compared to other operating systems.
	5)cost:
		linux is free to use which makes it an attractive option for individual and organization for budget friendly
	6)community support:
			there is a large community of users and developers who contribute to the development of linux and provide support to the user.
	Q)what is operating system definition??
	Def:
		an operating system is a collection of software that manages computer hardware resources and provides common services for computer programs.
		an operating system performs the following functions:
			1)resource management
			2)memory management
			3)process management
			4)security management
			5)communication management
			6)input or output control management.
		eg:
			microsoft windows,mac, linux,....etc
		Q)what is a linux??
		A)=>free and opensource operating system.
			=>it is created in 1991 by "linus torvolds".
			=>it is completely based on the unix operating systems.
			=>it is widely used on servers,super computers & personal computers.
