LINUX FILE SYSTEM:
	LINUX FILE system is organised into a hiearchy with the root directory on the top
	some subdirectories that we use in linux for the typesof files.
		/etc => system configuration files.
		/usr =>user programs and libraries.
		/home =>user home directories.
