list
----------

ls ---> shows contents of the dir.
ls -l --> list contents of current dir in long form.
ls -s  ---> list the contents and size of the files of current dir.
ls -sh ---> list the size in readable form.
ls -lh --->list in long form and readable.
ls -ltr ---> long list, time, reverse order.
ls -i   ----> gives the unique id of each file in current dir.
ls -p  ----> path of the files in the dir.
ls -d */ ----> shows only dir & not files.
ls -n  ----> numeric user id & group id
