PERMISSIONS:
u --> user
g --> group
o --> other

r---> read  100 --4 	r__
w---> write 010 --2		 _w_
x---> execute 001--1 	__x


1) numeric method:
111 -(7) ----> read, write, execute.
101 -(5) ----> read and execute.
110 -(6) ----> read and write.


chmod 777 dir_name.
 chmod 777 filename.
 chmod 775 dir_name

2) symobolic methods:

+  --> add permission
-  --> remove the permiossion.

chmod u+wx,g-wx,o+rw dir_name.
 chmod u-rx,g-wx,o+rw filename.
 example: 
 create a dir with name vlsiguru, first give all permissions by using numerical method. 
 note : you are in root dir

rwxrwxrwx ---->r_x,_wx,rw_   ----> by using symbolic method.

